Input #0, mov,mp4,m4a,3gp,3g2,mj2, from '/Users/tydussimonini/Documents/Godot/PardonMe/Music/Airplane Mode.m4a':
  Metadata:
    major_brand     : isom
    minor_version   : 512
    compatible_brands: isomiso2mp41
    encoder         : Lavf60.16.100
    lyrics          : [Intro]
                    : I put my phone face down
                    : Like that could calm me down
                    : [Verse 1]
                    : Your name is still a match beneath my thumb
                    : I know exactly what I shouldn't do
                    : So I tapped the little plane and watched it come
                    : A tiny silver promise pulling through
                    : The room got quiet, but I heard your voice
                    : In every little engine overhead
                    : If you were done, you'd make another choice
                    : You'd leave me something more than seen and read
                    : [Pre-Chorus]
                    : So if the sky is keeping you away
                    : If there's a reason you can't answer me
                    : Then maybe we're the same kind of afraid
                    : Just waiting for the other one to see
                    : [Chorus]
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : Find me where the lost hearts go
                    : If you can't call, then you must be close
                    : Flying through the blue just to get home
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : No signal, but I think I know
                    : Your silence isn't letting me go
                    : You're up there searching from below
                    : Love me, love me on airplane mode
                    : Love me, love me on airplane mode
                    : [Verse 2]
                    : I checked the window like a hopeful fool
                    : For one small wing to circle back around
                    : I made a map of every altitude
                    : And drew your little heart above my town
                    : My friends say, "Girl, he's probably asleep"
                    : But they don't know the way you look at me
                    : You'd cross an ocean just to hear me breathe
                    : You'd lose the world to keep from losing me
                    : [Pre-Chorus]
                    : So if the sky is keeping you away
                    : If there's a reason you can't answer me
                    : Then maybe we're the same kind of afraid
                    : Just waiting for the other one to see
                    : [Chorus]
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : Find me where the lost hearts go
                    : If you can't call, then you must be close
                    : Flying through the blue just to get home
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : No signal, but I think I know
                    : Your silence isn't letting me go
                    : You're up there searching from below
                    : Love me, love me on airplane mode
                    : [Bridge]
                    : Maybe you're above the clouds tonight
                    : Maybe you can see my bedroom light
                    : Maybe every mile you disappear
                    : Is one more mile that brings you here
                    : I won't turn it off, I won't turn it off
                    : [Final Chorus]
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : Find me where the lost hearts go
                    : If you can't call, then you must be close
                    : Flying through the blue just to get home
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : No signal, but I think I know
                    : Your silence isn't letting me go
                    : You're up there searching from below
                    : Come down, come down, come down to me
                    : I know you're somewhere in the atmosphere
                    : Love me on airplane mode
                    : I can feel you getting near
